        <div class="prose">
          <div class="callout">
            <p><strong>If anyone is injured, or the road is blocked or dangerous, call 999 immediately.</strong> That comes before anything else, including calling us. West Midlands Police may attend the scene, and any vehicle recovery is planned around their instructions and timing.</p>
          </div>

          <h2>Recovery after a collision, done carefully</h2>
          <p>An accident is different from a mechanical breakdown, and it needs a different level of care. A vehicle involved in a collision might have a damaged wheel, a bent axle, a compromised body panel, or other issues that make standard loading unsafe if it's not handled correctly. We take that into account, assessing the vehicle at the scene and using the right method to move it without causing further damage or risk, anywhere across <a href="../areas/birmingham.html">Birmingham</a> and the West Midlands.</p>
          <p>This service is specifically for collision damage. If your vehicle has developed a mechanical fault rather than being involved in an accident, our <a href="breakdown-recovery-birmingham.html">breakdown recovery</a> or general <a href="car-recovery-birmingham.html">car recovery</a> pages are the better starting point.</p>

          <h2>Where we can take your vehicle</h2>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> A garage or dealership of your choice.</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> A bodyshop for repair assessment.</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> An insurer-approved repairer or location.</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Secure storage while you decide next steps.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Working around the scene</h2>
          <p>At the scene of a collision, our priority is getting your vehicle recovered safely without getting in the way of the police, ambulance service, or anyone else attending. We'll wait for the go-ahead where the scene needs to be managed first, and we'll ask what's needed before starting any recovery work.</p>

          <h2>A note on insurance</h2>
          <p>We're not able to give legal or insurance advice, so it's worth checking with your insurer about what they need from you, and which repairer or process applies to your policy, as early as you can. Once you know where your vehicle needs to go, we'll take it there.</p>
